{"steam_appid":3301060,"steam_name":"Desktop Mate","trailer_hls":"https://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/3301060/1808377965/8df6a964dc2cd9f785aa0d96e0558a444f2eb1b7/1776996647/hls_264_master.m3u8?t=1777000005","trailer_thumb":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/257325409/16262b62913a396393faf5cecfdf1153041093e8/movie_600x337.jpg?t=1777000005","screenshots":["https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3301060/ss_6ebf74e39b8b333881b63d381c3869afb0d8fae8.1920x1080.jpg?t=1784776394","https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3301060/ss_4934d24e3bfd564e382ee1ffe8cb827c54f38408.1920x1080.jpg?t=1784776394","https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3301060/ss_4dcbb91d7bd8cd58cc64dea1aafd9d727e9e2c39.1920x1080.jpg?t=1784776394","https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3301060/ss_50ca5da5d03083c00e32ac1ad887a5d21ea83722.1920x1080.jpg?t=1784776394","https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3301060/ss_46094c333bdb6d93c6d9a1114e67f34f9047f6f6.1920x1080.jpg?t=1784776394"],"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3301060/extras/c886a42c25d0e865c0358cd0413f2afc.avif?t=1784776394\" width=1170 height=100 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Stay close to the characters you love—right on your desktop.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3301060/extras/e6cff7b988cf22d395b258ba6317e3b4.avif?t=1784776394\" width=1170 height=100 /></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>A little more joy on your desktop, every day.</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Always together with your favorite characters.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >They sit on top of your windows, tell you the time, and more.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Your everyday desktop, just a little happier.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Popular Character DLC—More on the Way!</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3301060/extras/921443a0eebb442dd12d3a824c0a18f8.avif?t=1784776394\" width=1170 height=5032 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >What Makes Your Desktop More Fun</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3301060/extras/71c5f6572a34148a722c3ab8adf27471.webp?t=1784776394\" width=1170 height=40 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3301060/extras/8a50c5a49dbe784d1d9095954e8f8f75.poster.avif?t=1784776394\" width=1170 height=656 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3301060/extras/8a50c5a49dbe784d1d9095954e8f8f75.webm?t=1784776394\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3301060/extras/8a50c5a49dbe784d1d9095954e8f8f75.mp4?t=1784776394\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Drag a character onto a window, and they'll sit right on top of it. Just watching them jump from window to window is soothing. A core feature of Desktop Mate—stay together even while you work.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3301060/extras/c3c777502eef71995d0602279486fb11.webp?t=1784776394\" width=1170 height=40 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3301060/extras/9f16b748b6c21df2600307e246881fe2.poster.avif?t=1784776394\" width=1170 height=656 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3301060/extras/9f16b748b6c21df2600307e246881fe2.webm?t=1784776394\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3301060/extras/9f16b748b6c21df2600307e246881fe2.mp4?t=1784776394\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Characters react to your mouse cursor by chasing and playing with it. Their charming gestures add a touch of fun to your desktop.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3301060/extras/fe9a3b6fa02e153243d62acc43dc3c22.webp?t=1784776394\" width=1170 height=40 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3301060/extras/da5de957cb50accca33a5abddc955058.poster.avif?t=1784776394\" width=1170 height=656 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3301060/extras/da5de957cb50accca33a5abddc955058.webm?t=1784776394\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3301060/extras/da5de957cb50accca33a5abddc955058.mp4?t=1784776394\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Characters play voice lines in various scenes! With voices for clicks, head pats, and other interactions, it feels as if they're really there.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >* Voice content varies by DLC character.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3301060/extras/617ac257fdebbfb7a4e2c159ce9d2698.webp?t=1784776394\" width=1170 height=40 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3301060/extras/a391680a7d5f95072d96a51304afc89e.poster.avif?t=1784776394\" width=1170 height=656 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3301060/extras/a391680a7d5f95072d96a51304afc89e.webm?t=1784776394\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3301060/extras/a391680a7d5f95072d96a51304afc89e.mp4?t=1784776394\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The built-in alarm feature lets your characters tell you when it's time! Set an alarm, and your characters will let you know when it goes off!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >* Some DLCs include special mascot characters that appear when alarms go off.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3301060/extras/c927f0488f12236dc31d20e06b83318f.webp?t=1784776394\" width=1170 height=40 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3301060/extras/f3745d41d1924b570ecb80fe0ee7f63e.poster.avif?t=1784776394\" width=1170 height=656 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3301060/extras/f3745d41d1924b570ecb80fe0ee7f63e.webm?t=1784776394\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3301060/extras/f3745d41d1924b570ecb80fe0ee7f63e.mp4?t=1784776394\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The multi-character feature lets you display several characters at once! Line up your favorites on your desktop and enjoy them together.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >*This feature is currently available only in the beta version.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3301060/extras/cbe256cf740da907a0d94ef01a4b15e1.webp?t=1784776394\" width=1170 height=40 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3301060/extras/e1d6ef76d33153435697ab7e428842d2.poster.avif?t=1784776394\" width=1170 height=656 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3301060/extras/e1d6ef76d33153435697ab7e428842d2.webm?t=1784776394\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3301060/extras/e1d6ef76d33153435697ab7e428842d2.mp4?t=1784776394\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Special actions trigger between certain character pairs! For example, displaying Kagamine Rin/Len together unlocks playful exchanges and synchronized movements only the twins can perform.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >* More character combos coming in future updates.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3301060/extras/4ce5e8293f7dd2998379c15e587bb57d.webp?t=1784776394\" width=1170 height=40 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3301060/extras/675b4c999921c68a19e11b0693930ed3.poster.avif?t=1784776394\" width=1170 height=656 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3301060/extras/675b4c999921c68a19e11b0693930ed3.webm?t=1784776394\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3301060/extras/675b4c999921c68a19e11b0693930ed3.mp4?t=1784776394\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Syncs with &quot;Mahjong Soul&quot;! Desktop Mate characters react in real time to in-game actions.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >* This feature requires the Mahjong Soul &quot;Chibi Ichihime&quot; DLC.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3301060/extras/90cc30b4725b0dc423e7bef1375ae5f0.webp?t=1784776394\" width=1170 height=40 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3301060/extras/413bb34176083c0aa090692e5c7f9f17.poster.avif?t=1784776394\" width=1170 height=656 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3301060/extras/413bb34176083c0aa090692e5c7f9f17.webm?t=1784776394\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3301060/extras/413bb34176083c0aa090692e5c7f9f17.mp4?t=1784776394\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Every feature is thoughtfully designed to never disrupt your day. Make characters bigger to enjoy their presence, or smaller to keep things tidy. When not in use, they quietly tuck away at the edge of your screen—keeping things comfortable, even for long sessions.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Latest News</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Desktop Mate keeps growing with new characters and features.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >From new ways to interact with characters to handy new features, Desktop Mate keeps evolving.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Follow our official X account (@desktop_mate) for the latest updates!</p>","requirements_minimum":"<strong>Minimum:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li>Requires a 64-bit processor and operating system<br></li><li><strong>OS:</strong> Windows 10 64bit / Windows 11 64bit<br></li><li><strong>Processor:</strong> Intel Core i5-8250U 1.6GHz / AMD Ryzen 3 3300U<br></li><li><strong>Memory:</strong> 8 GB RAM<br></li><li><strong>Graphics:</strong> Intel UHD Graphics 730 / Radeon VEGA 8<br></li><li><strong>Storage:</strong> 500 MB available space<br></li><li><strong>Additional Notes:</strong> A GPU or a CPU with integrated graphics is required. These requirements are based on displaying one character (required performance may increase depending on the number of characters displayed and your settings).</li></ul>","requirements_recommended":"<strong>Recommended:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li>Requires a 64-bit processor and operating system<br></li><li><strong>OS:</strong> Windows 11 64bit<br></li><li><strong>Processor:</strong> Intel Core i5-11400 2.6GHz / AMD Ryzen 5 3600<br></li><li><strong>Memory:</strong> 16 GB RAM<br></li><li><strong>Graphics:</strong> NVIDIA GeForce GTX 750 / AMD Radeon RX550 / Intel Iris Xe Graphics / Radeon VEGA 11<br></li><li><strong>Storage:</strong> 4 GB available space<br></li><li><strong>Additional Notes:</strong> A GPU or a CPU with integrated graphics is required. These requirements are based on displaying one character (required performance may increase depending on the number of characters displayed and your settings).</li></ul>","genres":["Free To Play","Animation & Modeling","Utilities"],"developers":["infiniteloop"],"publishers":["infiniteloop"],"release_date":"7 Jan, 2025"}